// Into a fissure by its east mouth (24 m down), to the mouth's inner edge, at no cost. The layout (sites.rs)
// joins every part of the fissure to a way in (tests/found_places.rs; floor and bridges, with ropes). The
// mouth's floor is the 24 m deck's top since the site-trap fix (it used to step into a 0.5 m slot by the
// wall); `site_fissure_east_bridge.scn` walks on along the bridge. The ropes still hang under the bridges, so
// from above the way down is a drop (REFINE-movement.md).
map
